on Bureau (EDB) will continue to implement the admission arrangements for K1 classes in kindergartens (KGs) for the 2027/28 school year (hereafter referred to as \"2027/28 K1 Admission Arrangements\") with a view to facilitating the smooth operation of the admission process of KGs and helping parents secure a KG place for their children in a timely manner. EDB Circular Memorandum (EDBCM) No. 80/2026 was issued on 8 June 2026 to all KGs.\n\n  * Guidelines on Kindergarten Admission Arrangements PDF  \n\n  * 2027/28 K1 Admission Arrangements Flowchart \n\nNote:\n1. If parents are unable to allow the KG in which their child has been admitted to scan the QR code on the e-RC/AP during the Centralised Registration Dates, the KG concerned may not be able to complete registration for their child.  Hence, parents are required to submit application to EDB within the designated period.\n2. If a child is admitted after the Centralised Registration Dates, his/her parent is still required to submit the e-RC/AP for registration.  If the parent intends to change school for his/her child after registration with a KG, he/she is required to complete the de-registration with the KG with which he/she has registered by scanning the QR code on the e-RC/AP.  Upon de-registration, the KG concerned will no longer reserve the place for the child.  Normally, the registration fee paid to the KG with which the parent has registered will not be refunded.\n\n  * Reference Documents for Admission Arrangements for Nursery (K1) Classes in Kindergartens\n\n  * Frequently Asked Questions PDF \n  * List of Local Kindergartens (KGs) Not Joining the KG Education Scheme but Participating in the 2027/28 K1 Admission Arrangements PDF \n\nRemarks:\n\n    1. The above list reflects the situation up to mid-July 2026 and may be updated as required.\n    2. The list is arranged in alphabetical order by school names in English.\n    3. For the general information of KGs, please visit the “Profile of Kindergartens and Kindergarten-cum-Child Care Centres” website at: https://www.chsc.hk/kindergarten/en--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n「2027/28 K1 收生安排」 - 教育局 (https://www.edb.gov.hk/tc/edu-system/preprimary-kindergarten/kindergarten-k1-admission-arrangements/2728_admission_arrangements.html)\nciteturn2680search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4 months ago; Crawled: today; 教育局繼續於2027/28學年推行2027/28學年幼稚園幼兒班（K1）收生安排（下稱「2027/28 K1收生安排」），讓幼稚園的收生程序更為暢順，有關家長亦可適時落實其子女的幼稚園學位。 ...   * 幼稚園收生安排指引 PDF ...   * 參加「2027/28 K1 收生安排」的非幼稚園教育計劃的本地幼稚園名單 PDF ... 有關幼稚園的一般資料，可瀏覽「幼稚園及幼稚園暨幼兒中心概覽」網頁：https://www.chsc.hk/kindergarten/\n\n# 「2027/28 K1 收生安排」\n                                                                                                                                                                                                             \n  * 通函 PDF\n\n教育局繼續於2027/28學年推行2027/28學年幼稚園幼兒班（K1）收生安排（下稱「2027/28 K1收生安排」），讓幼稚園的收生程序更為暢順，有關家長亦可適時落實其子女的幼稚園學位。本局已於2026年6月8日向幼稚園發出通函第80/2026號。\n\n  * 幼稚園收生安排指引 PDF \n\n  * 「2027/28 K1 收生安排」流程圖  \n\nImage\n\n註:\n\n1. 如家長未能於「統一註冊日期」內攜帶電子「註冊證」／「入學許可書」到取錄其子女的幼稚園辦理註冊手續，該幼稚園或未能為其子女進行註冊。因此，家長須在指定日期內向教育局遞交「註冊證」的申請。\n2. 如兒童於「統一註冊日期」後獲取錄，家長仍須以電子「註冊證」／「入學許可書」註冊。如家長在一所幼稚園註冊後打算為子女轉校，須到原先註冊的幼稚園掃描電子「註冊證」／「入學許可書」上的二維碼以完成取消註冊手續。如家長已完成取消註冊手續，即代表該幼稚園不會再為該兒童保留學位。一般來說，其原先註冊的幼稚園不會退還「註冊費」。\n\n  * 幼稚園收生安排指引 PDF \n\n  * 「2027/28 K1 收生安排」流程圖  \n\nImage\n\n註:\n\n1. 如家長未能於「統一註冊日期」內攜帶電子「註冊證」／「入學許可書」到取錄其子女的幼稚園辦理註冊手續，該幼稚園或未能為其子女進行註冊。因此，家長須在指定日期內向教育局遞交「註冊證」的申請。\n2. 如兒童於「統一註冊日期」後獲取錄，家長仍須以電子「註冊證」／「入學許可書」註冊。如家長在一所幼稚園註冊後打算為子女轉校，須到原先註冊的幼稚園掃描電子「註冊證」／「入學許可書」上的二維碼以完成取消註冊手續。如家長已完成取消註冊手續，即代表該幼稚園不會再為該兒童保留學位。一般來說，其原先註冊的幼稚園不會退還「註冊費」。\n\n  * 幼稚園幼兒班（K1）收生安排文件範本（只供參考） \n\n  * 「2027/28 K1收生安排」 常見問題 PDF \n  * 參加「2027/28 K1 收生安排」的非幼稚園教育計劃的本地幼稚園名單 PDF \n\n註：\n\n      1. 以上資料截至2026年7月中旬，有關資料在有需要時更新。\n      2. 以上名單所示幼稚園以學校英文字母名稱排列。\n      3. 有關幼稚園的一般資料，可瀏覽「幼稚園及幼稚園暨幼兒中心概覽」網頁：https://www.chsc.hk/kindergarten/-------------------------------------------------------